      "q": "What are the challenges people face when they have to move to a new place?",
      "a": "The challenges faced by the people when they move to a new place are:\nNew place means new adjustment\nSearch for new jobs\nNew school\nChanged environment\nLanguage and culture barriers\nDifferences in beliefs, traditions\nMaking acquaintance with new people."
